# hooks/examples/ holds the configurations we ship for other projects to copy,
# not configuration for this one. Without this, prek's workspace discovery
# finds them, treats hooks/examples/ as a nested project, and tries to install
# gdck's own hooks at whatever rev the samples pin — which fails outright in
# the window before that tag is pushed.
#
# tools/test-hooks.sh is what actually exercises those files.
hooks/examples/
